{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Two students are dead.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have one week inside a 1997 American high school to figure out why.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SideEye High</strong> is a grounded, consequence-driven point-and-click detective mystery built around observation, interpretation, and omission. You won\u2019t be led from puzzle to puzzle. You decide what\u2019s worth investigating, what\u2019s worth following up on, and what gets left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nearly everything you see can be inspected or questioned. Floors, lockers, desks, notes, trash, and details most games ignore can all become evidence. You cannot inspect everything \u2014 and what you miss changes what you believe happened.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What you notice matters. What you miss does too.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everything Is Inspectable</strong><br>Environments are fully searchable, down to scuff marks, screws, and overlooked details.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evidence Notebook</strong><br>Log fingerprints, handwriting, footprints, notes, and observations as you build your case.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Fail States</strong> <br>The investigation always moves forward. Your conclusions, correct or not, shape how the case unfolds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Main Mystery, Dozens of Detours</strong> <br>Follow the core case or get sidetracked by over 50 false endings, each with its own twisted mini-mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mature 90s Dark Humor</strong><br>Sharp, absurd, and occasionally uncomfortable satire rooted in late-90s Americana.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every student knows something. No one knows the whole truth.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103560/extras/a2c19bda2d10f163b7dd75d9e82fcb39.avif?t=1772844558\" width=616 height=308 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103560/extras/f099725af70cc3752a965bc47abe781a.avif?t=1772844558\" width=616 height=308 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103560/extras/e7bb1102913a2562f17f4987f46cf112.avif?t=1772844558\" width=616 height=308 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103560/extras/440be4481ea04637b0f91bfaeaf6ec8d.avif?t=1772844558\" width=616 height=308 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103560/extras/919446aa727d7783323abd4430c90193.avif?t=1772844558\" width=616 height=308 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103560/extras/65a72f8ae16946040356b42c43a9d83f.avif?t=1772844558\" width=616 height=308 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103560/extras/5891e610212941a59e1932e859cb0eed.avif?t=1772844558\" width=616 height=308 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103560/extras/9a1f074b676e6cd0828811332e5781e8.avif?t=1772844558\" width=616 height=308 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103560/extras/c30d8b34d4b460a010b85fdbe9e3157b.avif?t=1772844558\" width=616 height=308 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103560/extras/e0a000488b4398aeac7c30d824093e01.avif?t=1772844558\" width=616 height=308 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103560/extras/077b42845e9c4f9bd3da194b73f0f845.avif?t=1772844558\" width=616 height=308 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103560/extras/36240a8409b40dd752d73880d9b3fabd.avif?t=1772844558\" width=616 height=308 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103560/extras/3b9942636296cf43e951fa1e6d7c9be6.avif?t=1772844558\" width=616 height=308 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And Many More...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103560/extras/eae9d66a77b8adf3e5e52781bf9b28d9.avif?t=1772844558\" width=616 height=308 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SideEye High</strong> is for those who grew up loving adventure games and are ready for one that grew up with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd11Be among the first to crack the case \u2014 add to your wishlist now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3103560?t=1772844558","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103560/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772844558","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103560/4f182125458544182d74b1d3a606355f98a6d485/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772844558","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103560/4f182125458544182d74b1d3a606355f98a6d485/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772844558","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains frequent mature themes, including depictions of death, violence, and crime investigation, along with strong language, suggestive situations, and satirical references to real-world issues. All content is presented in a stylized 1990s cartoon art style and is not intended for children."},"demos":[{"appid":4093210,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Play the Demo \u2014 Start Your Investigation - Wishlist to keep your case open.</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This demo ends before the consequences do.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist <strong>SideEye High</strong> to keep the investigation open when the full case arrives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE DEMO IS LIVE </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo is the opening slice of the case. What you miss shapes what you believe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every hallway, drawer, and detail is yours to inspect.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Two students are dead.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have one week inside a 1997 American high school to figure out why.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SideEye High</strong> is a grounded, consequence-driven point-and-click detective mystery built around observation, interpretation, and omission. You won\u2019t be led from puzzle to puzzle. You decide what\u2019s worth investigating, what\u2019s worth following up on, and what gets left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nearly everything you see can be inspected or questioned. Floors, lockers, desks, notes, trash, and details most games ignore can all become evidence. You cannot inspect everything \u2014 and what you miss changes what you believe happened.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What you notice matters. What you miss does too.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everything Is Inspectable</strong><br>Environments are fully searchable, down to scuff marks, screws, and overlooked details.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evidence Notebook</strong><br>Log fingerprints, handwriting, footprints, notes, and observations as you build your case.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Fail States</strong> <br>The investigation always moves forward. Your conclusions, correct or not, shape how the case unfolds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Main Mystery, Dozens of Detours</strong> <br>Follow the core case or get sidetracked by over 50 false endings, each with its own twisted mini-mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mature 90s Dark Humor</strong><br>Sharp, absurd, and occasionally uncomfortable satire rooted in late-90s Americana.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every student knows something. No one knows the whole truth.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103560/extras/a2c19bda2d10f163b7dd75d9e82fcb39.avif?t=1772844558\" width=616 height=308 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103560/extras/f099725af70cc3752a965bc47abe781a.avif?t=1772844558\" width=616 height=308 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103560/extras/e7bb1102913a2562f17f4987f46cf112.avif?t=1772844558\" width=616 height=308 /></span>